    "title": "そこに心はあるか",
    "enTitle": "Seeking the Heart",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "これまでの捜査をおさらいしますと、侵入者は、図書室奥から\n資料保管室につながるドアを使って、忍び込んでいるようです。",
            "enText": "To review, our perpetrators are using the door in the back of \nthe library to sneak into the archive room.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 284,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 372,
                    "pathId": 7501722357008391187
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 257,
                    "pathId": 5482684489150090227
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 341,
                    "pathId": -5451644196784163084
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4024593896120114519,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "保管室内部を調べ、侵入者の痕跡、または異常等、\n何らかの手がかりを見つけるであります！",
            "enText": "We will investigate the archive room to find traces of intruders, \nirregularities, and any other clues we can find!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 224,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 254,
                    "pathId": 7608730443689627514
