        {
            "jpName": "シンコウウインディ",
            "enName": "Shinko Windy",
            "jpText": "お？　棚の下からロープが出てる。\n怪しい……引っ張ってみるのだ！",
            "enText": "Huh? There's a rope sticking out under the shelf. \nThat's suspicious… I'm gonna give it a pull!",
