            "pathId": -4231378114953582589,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ビッグさん！？　倒れる倒れるっ、危ないであります！\n1個ずつ運んで下さーいっ！",
            "enText": "Big-san!? They're going to fall! Be careful! \nPlease, move them one at a time!",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 178,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 8352655473860667793,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "あっ！　壁に何か書いてある！　なになに……？\n『ペース読み下手すぎ、私！　逃げの子につられるなって』だって。",
            "enText": "Wowie! Someone wrote on the wall! Let's see… \n\"I suck at reading the pace! The front runners always \npull me ahead\"",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 416,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 319,
                    "pathId": 4672506596704372387
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6440928979466496197,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハルウララ",
            "enName": "Haru Urara",
            "jpText": "そうだ！　お返事書こ～っと♪\n……き、み、は、先、行、？　ウ、ラ、ラ、は――",
            "enText": "Oh, I know! I'll write back ♪ \n\"You're a pace chaser? Urara\"…",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 305,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 82,
                    "pathId": 6771861936545717266
                },
