            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ウララ、ビッグ、ビコー、ウインディ！\n全゛員゛こ゛こ゛に゛集゛合゛ッ゛！！",
            "enText": "URARA! BIG! BIKO! WINDY! \nALL UNITS, TO ME! NOW!",
