        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（……あの表情……。\nどうして、苦々しさが……私の中にも広がるのだろう……）",
            "enText": "(…That look on her face… \nWhy is her bitter expression… digging a pit in my stomach…?)",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 274,
            "voiceIdx": 26,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 285,
                    "pathId": 8524257317078399219
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 313,
                    "pathId": -2443548198389238242
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 343,
                    "pathId": -7904832944805181232
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3360571720223401226,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（……いや、私の記憶から滲みだす。\n……昔の私が……味わった苦さだ）",
            "enText": "(…No… I recognize it, somewhere deep down. \n…I've tasted this bitterness before.)",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 323,
            "voiceIdx": 27,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 358,
                    "pathId": 3987533568605620237
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -947206686583051398
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 343,
                    "pathId": -6116350507083520074
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4553690002928654072,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "――小学生の頃、クラスメイト数人が、教室でサッカーを始めた。\n私は危険な行為であると全員に言い聞かせて、やめさせた。",
            "enText": "In grade school, my classmates started playing soccer in the \nclassroom. I warned them about their reckless behavior, and \nforced them to stop.",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 314,
            "voiceIdx": 28,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -5052406144007885926
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 2384141180183179965
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5975129094872268030,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "父さんは正しいことをした、勇気ある行動だと私を褒め称えた。\n私は、尊敬する父さんに褒められたことが、とても嬉しくて――",
            "enText": "My father praised me. He told me I was brave, that I did the \nright thing. When I heard those words from him, the man \nI respected so much… I was so overjoyed, I…",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 373,
            "voiceIdx": 29,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 444,
                    "pathId": 6929020349874803182
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": 656537625983673225
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 8727673904026504929,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "コンビニの前に座り込み、大声で騒いでいた大人の集団に対しても、\n店や他の人の迷惑になるからやめるよう、注意した。",
            "enText": "I saw a group of noisy adults loitering in front of a convenience \nstore. I told them off, warning them that they were being a \nnuisance.",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 286,
            "voiceIdx": 30,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": 7449470226735241219
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 13,
                    "pathId": -6966056010558744112
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7493663192036472268,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "幸い、彼らはあっさりと聞き入れてくれた。\nしかし、その話を聞いた父さんは……私を厳しく叱責した。",
            "enText": "Fortunately for me, they were reasonable enough to listen. \nBut when I told my father about it… \nHe gave me a harsh scolding.",
            "nextBlock": 33,
            "origClipLength": 372,
            "voiceIdx": 31,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 509,
                    "pathId": -2951108268904869804
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 21,
                    "pathId": -2786566276520622721
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 494,
                    "pathId": 7435677825215701919
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5788026565445652587,
            "blockIdx": 32
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "私の身を案じて叱ったのだと、今ならわかる。\nだが当時の私は、褒められると思っていたのに叱られて……。",
            "enText": "Now that I'm older, I realize that he was only trying to \nprotect me. But the only thing my young mind understood was \nthat I got scolded when I thought I would be praised.",
            "nextBlock": 34,
            "origClipLength": 349,
            "voiceIdx": 32,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 364,
                    "pathId": -421513663416587416
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 334,
                    "pathId": 8277781162616589070
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 494,
                    "pathId": 1647934650594180604
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4685834993235335730,
            "blockIdx": 33
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "ひどくショックを受けた。\n……私自身を、否定されたように感じたのだ。",
            "enText": "It sent a shock through my system. \n…Like my entire sense of self had be called into question.",
            "nextBlock": 35,
            "origClipLength": 249,
            "voiceIdx": 33,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 165,
                    "pathId": 2562171304129301456
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 201,
                    "pathId": 1651072910565539255
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 494,
                    "pathId": -6683989976323912626
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9120708639024703543,
            "blockIdx": 34
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（……ひょっとして、私は……）",
            "enText": "(…Did I…)",
            "nextBlock": 36,
            "origClipLength": 194,
            "voiceIdx": 34,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 265,
                    "pathId": -5263884684904473917
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 298,
                    "pathId": 7329110359728578042
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 494,
                    "pathId": -6903993831312723076
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3296524178658138168,
            "blockIdx": 35
        },
        {
            "jpName": "フェノーメノ",
            "enName": "Fenomeno",
            "jpText": "（あの時の自分と同じ気持ちを、\n彼女たちに味わわせてしまったのでは……？）",
            "enText": "(Did I force them to feel the same pain…?)",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "origClipLength": 222,
